### GET All Users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users

### Update Current User
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "admin1",
	"role": "ADMIN",
	"language": "ZH-TW"
}

### Delete Current User
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users?email=viewer@gmail.com